  "description": "Reusable .NET 8 library to read EUDI Wallet PID identity data via the EUDI Verifier Backend REST API (OpenID4VP). Builds the DCQL request (mso_mdoc and SD-JWT VC), polls for the wallet response and extracts the identity data, including SD-JWT disclosure parsing.",
