  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — Multi-backend support: serve several trust ecosystems from one app.\nAdded VerifierSettings.Backends / DefaultBackend / MdocOnlyBackends / IntendedUseIds /\nResponseModes, the TransactionOptions type, intended_use_id on the init request, and the\nGerman EUDI Wallet (Bundesdruckerei prototype) PID as a further SD-JWT VC option.\nNote: InitializeTransactionAsync gained an optional TransactionOptions parameter ahead of\nthe CancellationToken. Calls passing the token by name or omitting it are unaffected;\npositional InitializeTransactionAsync(ct) calls must be updated to (null, ct).",
